WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Bulk edit. Select many tasks in the list and change, move or delete them at once.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: re-planning; hand-over.

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:16.820
Choose Select to edit many tasks at once.

4
